0\", \"max_wall_thickness_mm\": \"4.390\", \"min_outer_diameter_mm\": \"25.100\", \"min_wall_thickness_mm\": \"4.260\"}]}','rule',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'E2E测试','2026-10-13 01:40:16','2026-10-13 01:40:26'),(9,'AN-20261013074943-P5AS',12,'generated','预警事件 QE-20261010-004WT（规则R5“连续3点接近区间边界”，指标 min_wall_thickness）于2026-10-10T10:15触发，对应批次12121D0032（甲班，PPR S2.5 25×4.2 瓷芯管，规格限4.200–4.800mm）。本批S-001至S-004最薄壁厚由4.320降至4.290、4.260、4.270mm，连续3点进入下限接近带但均未越下限，属“趋近下限”趋势型预警而非超限。同期设备窗口内挤出机EQ-EX-01压力由12.600降至12.200MPa、牵引速度由8.200升至8.450m/min。参考批次12121D0033/0034最薄壁厚稳定在4.34–4.39mm。本分析仅基于工具返回的QMS/SCADA记录，结论均为待工程师验证的假设，未确认最终根因。','{\"alert\": {\"id\": 12, \"source\": \"engine\", \"status\": \"open\", \"spec_id\": 1, \"batch_id\": 1, \"batch_no\": \"12121D0032\", \"event_no\": \"QE-20261010-004WT\", \"record_no\": \"IR-20261010-004\", \"rule_code\": \"R5\", \"rule_name\": \"连续3点接近区间边界\", \"sample_no\": \"S-004\", \"spec_name\": \"PPR S2.5 25×4.2 瓷芯管\", \"created_at\": \"2026-10-13T07:26:22.000Z\", \"ovality_mm\": \"0.240\", \"risk_level\": \"medium\", \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-13T07:26:22.000Z\", \"data_source\": \"QMS\", \"detected_at\": \"2026-10-10T10:15:00.000Z\", \"metric_code\": \"min_wall_thickness\", \"inspect_time\": \"2026-10-10T10:15:00.000Z\", \"wall_lower_mm\": \"4.200\", \"wall_upper_mm\": \"4.800\", \"measurement_id\": 4, \"observed_value\": \"4.2700\", \"outer_lower_mm\": \"25.000\", \"outer_upper_mm\": \"25.500\", \"threshold_text\": \"4.200 mm–4.800 mm，连续 3 点进入接近带（距下限 ≤ 0.090 mm，为区间宽度的 15%）：4.290 / 4.260 / 4.270\", \"ovality_upper_mm\": \"0.350\", \"production_group\": \"甲班\", \"outer_diameter_mm\": \"25.260\", \"max_outer_diameter_mm\": \"25.360\", \"max_wall_thickness_mm\": \"4.420\", \"min_outer_diameter_mm\": \"25.120\", \"min_wall_thickness_mm\": \"4.270\"}, \"toolEvidence\": [{\"tool\": \"get_alert_context\", \"input\": {}, \"output\": {\"id\": 12, \"source\": \"engine\", \"status\": \"open\", \"spec_id\": 1, \"batch_id\": 1, \"batch_no\": \"12121D0